coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder organizations edit [flags]

  Edit organization settings.

    - Replace the roles every member of the organization holds:
  
       $ coder organizations edit --default-org-member-roles
  organization-workspace-access,organization-template-admin
  
    - Grant members no roles at all:
  
       $ coder organizations edit --clear-default-org-member-roles

OPTIONS:
      --clear-default-org-member-roles bool
          Remove every default member role, leaving members with no organization
          roles.

      --default-org-member-roles string-array
          Replaces the roles every member of the organization holds. Accepts a
          comma-separated list and may be repeated. New organizations start with
          organization-workspace-access, which grants members access to their
          own workspaces.

  -y, --yes bool
          Bypass confirmation prompts.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
